## Small functional gate verified (2026-09-24)

`small_test_v4` now passes end-to-end on the 300-contig `comebin_small` set with the real COMEBin pipeline (30 epochs, seed 42, 8 threads): 3 non-empty bins, 122 s wall time. CheckM2 reports mean completeness/contamination **26.07% / 2.02%**; CheckM v1 (Python 3.10-compatible runner) reports **29.08% / 0.71%**. Results are in [`results/small_test_v4.csv`](https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/blob/main/results/small_test_v4.csv) and the mirrored run evidence.

The prior `small_test_v3` exposed and fixed a masked failure: `KMeans(n_jobs=-1)` under sklearn 1.1.3. COMEBin fix `c8f22e4` is pushed on `comebin-small-fix`; the harness now rejects wrapper success with zero bins, detects the `.fa` evaluation extension, uses a working CheckM v1 environment, and validates both evaluation tables. The medium 3,000-contig derivative is the next gated step.

