{"body":"It would be good to add some plots and table that are automatically updated for each benchmark run to the readme, showing bar / swarm plots or heatmaps that show performance comp. and cont for each bin, it woud be able to compare runs on the same benchmark dataset","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWmUS1g","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"The harness already records one machine-readable CSV per completed run and keeps the living comparison table in `README.md`; raw CheckM2/CheckM tables and run metadata are mirrored under `runs/`. Automatic bar/swarm/heatmap plots are not implemented yet. I’ll treat plot generation and same-dataset comparison as a follow-up after the active medium run, rather than claiming that reporting is complete.\n","createdAt":"2026-09-24T09:30:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5811540694","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWnUN4w","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Implemented — automatic per-bin plots, regenerated after every evaluated run:\n\n- **Per-run bar chart** `runs/<run>/per_bins.png`: one bar group per bin with CheckM2 + CheckM v1 completeness and contamination (e.g. [baseline](https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/blob/main/runs/baseline_rerun_autorestart1/per_bins.png), [medium](https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/blob/main/runs/medium_v11_20260924/per_bins.png)).\n- **Comparison scatter** [results/figures/comp_vs_cont_all-runs.png](https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/blob/main/results/figures/comp_vs_cont_all-runs.png): one point per bin, x = contamination, y = completeness, color = run — directly comparable across runs on the same dataset (baseline vs fix_v11 once the full fix run completes).\n- Generator: `scripts/make_per_bin_plots.py <rundir>...` (matplotlib, comebin env); run automatically right after `make_per_bin_csv.py` in the post-eval workflow. Same-dataset comparison figures are keyed via `-k <dataset>`.\n\nCommitted as `7c0d4bd`; README Results section links all figures.","createdAt":"2026-09-24T10:44:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5812588003","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWnqxxA","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Closed by automation — addressed: Plots auto-generated (per-bin bar runs/<run>/per_bins.png + all-runs scatter results/figures/comp_vs_cont_all-runs.png, 3 PNGs committed 7c0d4bd); make_per_bin_plots.py --all wired into run_eval.sh (2524e12) to regenerate after every evaluated run. ","createdAt":"2026-09-24T11:12:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5812957636","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWnzD3A","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Comparison scatter should be subplots for each dataset and shown in the readme","createdAt":"2026-09-24T11:22:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5813093340","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWn9PzQ","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Done — the comparison is now a per-dataset subplot figure and renders in the README:\n\n- New [results/figures/comp_vs_cont_by_dataset.png](https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/blob/main/results/figures/comp_vs_cont_by_dataset.png): one panel per benchmark dataset (COMEBin demo / small / medium), runs colored within each panel — direct same-dataset comparison, current: baseline (60 bins, demo), small_test_v4 (3), medium_v11 (16). Once the full fix run finishes it joins the demo panel next to the baseline.\n- README Results now embeds this figure (image + link); all-runs scatter and per-run bar charts still generated.\n- Dataset is auto-derived per run from run_meta.txt (scripts/make_per_bin_plots.py, `dataset_of()`), regenerated automatically after every eval via run_eval.sh → commit `53a4b25`.","createdAt":"2026-09-24T11:33:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5813260237","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWzb9RQ","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Closed by automation — addressed: Per-dataset comparison subplot figure results/figures/comp_vs_cont_by_dataset.png auto-generated after every evaluated run and embedded in the README (commit 53a4b25); regenerated after fix_v11 evaluation with all 4 runs. ","createdAt":"2026-09-25T01:43:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5825297733","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW22W8Q","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"I want a bar plot as made here: https://github.com/usegalaxy-eu/FAIRyMAGs/blob/ea208ac41a39135469bf4bc59d77954deb86bfb8/bin/compare_use-cases.ipynb (combined_bar_plot.png)\nfor the main benchmark datasets, focus only on 3 from now on, label each bar by the commit and branch of the comebin version used, one subplot for each benchmark dataset, show it in the readme.md","createdAt":"2026-09-25T07:49:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5828876017","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW24tcw","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"under the bar plot I want the stats of those runs as table","createdAt":"2026-09-25T07:52:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5828914547","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"number":12,"title":"Improve reporting","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T07:52:59Z"}
