[{"body":"It would be good to add some plots and table that are automatically updated for each benchmark run to the readme, showing bar / swarm plots or heatmaps that show performance comp. and cont for each bin, it woud be able to compare runs on the same benchmark dataset","number":12,"title":"Improve reporting","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T08:41:17Z"},{"body":"Can you add newly created benchmark data to zenodo, so we not loose it, document it, what do you need for this ?","number":8,"title":"Add benchmark data to zenodo","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T08:42:51Z"},{"body":"Try to optimize tool and parameters to use less time and resources but aim for similar or better performane, think about good performane measured numbet of bins, contigs size, compl. Cont. F1 score check cami papers for infos \nMaybe perams can be automatically set based on input file size or contig stats","number":6,"title":"Optimization","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T20:56:21Z"},{"body":"## How this works\n\nThis issue (and any issue you open in this repo) is read by the benchmark agent on a\nrolling basis — it replies here with status/answers, and its restart prompt tells it to\ncheck issues first.\n\n**How to give an idea:** open a new issue (or comment here) with as much detail as you\nhave. Examples of what the agent can act on:\n\n- \"try binners X and Y on the CAMI II dataset\" — gets executed and recorded in `docs/` + `results/`\n- \"COMEBin/src/cluster.py line N is wrong, do Y\" — becomes a fix batch on branch `comebin-optimizations`\n- \"change threads / add parameter sweeps\" — benchmark config change\n\n**Conventions the agent follows:**\n\n- every answer/implementation is documented in `docs/03-fixes.md` (fix batches) or\n  `docs/01-datasets.md` (datasets) and referenced from the issue\n- benchmark results land in `results/` as one CSV per run\n- current task state: `PROGRESS.md`\n\n---\n*agent note: this issue was created by the agent as a starting point; see\n`docs/05-agent-restart.md` for how the agent is woken/resumed.*","number":1,"title":"Idea inbox: benchmark ideas, COMEBin fixes, dataset requests","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T14:53:13Z"}]
