less specific type requested. marine_v11_20260925 run active at epoch 118/200.","createdAt":"2026-09-25T10:57:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5831252251","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW53ctA","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"I want this type of plot: https://github.com/usegalaxy-eu/FAIRyMAGs/blob/ea208ac41a39135469bf4bc59d77954deb86bfb8/bin/compare_use-cases.ipynb  what is the issue ?","createdAt":"2026-09-25T12:02:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5832039604","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"number":12,"state":"OPEN","title":"Improve reporting","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T12:02:37Z"}
