ataset subplots auto-regenerate after every evaluated run via run_eval.sh. Run metadata (dataset, threads, bins) is recorded in results/ and mirrored in README tables. The current setup covers the main reporting requests from issue #12. Are there any remaining gaps or specific plot types not addressed by the existing auto-generation pipeline?\n","createdAt":"2026-09-25T15:34:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5835059296","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"number":12,"title":"Improve reporting"}
