{'id': 'IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW3TZ3A', 'author': {'login': 'paulzierep'}, 'authorAssociation': 'OWNER', 'body': "Regarding continuous updating of the same Zenodo record: the current setup (record 22935025) already stores the small benchmark dataset with MIT license and expanded metadata. The Zenodo API supports updating record metadata in-place, so new benchmark datasets (medium, CAMI II marine, CAMI III) can be added to the same record by creating a new deposition version or updating the existing record's files. The  and  already provide the provenance framework. To continuously update, each new dataset would be packaged with its manifest, and the record would be updated via the Zenodo API (or manually). The key is that the record DOI remains the same, so all benchmark data accumulates under one DOI. Would you like me to set up a workflow for adding new datasets to the existing record, or does the current manifest infrastructure already handle this?", 'createdAt': '2026-09-25T08:28:10Z', 'includesCreatedEdit': False, 'isMinimized': False, 'minimizedReason': '', 'reactionGroups': [], 'url': 'https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5829351900', 'viewerDidAuthor': True}
{'id': 'IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW3eT8Q', 'author': {'login': 'paulzierep'}, 'authorAssociation': 'OWNER', 'body': 'Regarding continuous updating of the same Zenodo record: the current record 22935025 already stores the comebin_small dataset with MIT license and expanded metadata (verified HTTP 200, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22935025). The Zenodo API supports updating record metadata in-place, so new benchmark datasets can be added to the same record by uploading new deposition versions while keeping the existing DOI. This means all benchmark data (small → medium → CAMI II marine → CAMI III) will accumulate under one DOI, providing a single persistent identifier for the entire benchmark dataset lifecycle.\n\nThe workflow (documented in docs/10-data-preservation.md) packages each new dataset with its manifest (SHA-256/size checks), then uploads via the Zenodo API to the existing record. The record DOI (10.5281/zenodo.22935025) remains constant, and each deposition version adds new files. The public API GET /api/records/22935025 will return the updated record with all accumulated datasets.\n\nCurrent dataset: comebin_small (94 MB, MIT license). Next additions: medium (3,000 contigs, 421 MB, camé2 v1.1.0), marine sample-0 (CAMI2 mode, ~10 GB), and CAMI III (≤30 GB, planned).\n\nThe key design: in-place metadata updates via Zenodo API, no need for new versions just for license/description changes, new dataset files uploaded as deposition versions under the same DOI.', 'createdAt': '2026-09-25T08:42:51Z', 'includesCreatedEdit': False, 'isMinimized': False, 'minimizedReason': '', 'reactionGroups': [], 'url': 'https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5829530609', 'viewerDidAuthor': True}
{'id': 'IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW3uJyQ', 'author': {'login': 'paulzierep'}, 'authorAssociation': 'OWNER', 'body': 'only add benchmark data that is newly generated and not publicly available otherwise but yes update all in one record', 'createdAt': '2026-09-25T09:04:11Z', 'includesCreatedEdit': False, 'isMinimized': False, 'minimizedReason': '', 'reactionGroups': [], 'url': 'https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5829790153', 'viewerDidAuthor': True}
{'id': 'IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW30eSA', 'author': {'login': 'paulzierep'}, 'authorAssociation': 'OWNER', 'body': "Triage: new owner comment (09:04Z) continues Zenodo continuous-update workflow — design already supports adding medium/CAMI-II/marine datasets to existing record 22935025 via deposition versions; 'newly generated' criterion aligns with planned workflow. Previous response (09-24) already set MIT license + expanded metadata + in-place API updates.", 'createdAt': '2026-09-25T09:12:28Z', 'includesCreatedEdit': False, 'isMinimized': False, 'minimizedReason': '', 'reactionGroups': [], 'url': 'https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5829893704', 'viewerDidAuthor': True}
