{'id': 'IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABW8W57A', 'author': {'login': 'paulzierep'}, 'authorAssociation': 'OWNER', 'body': "Benchmark data preservation is already in place via Zenodo: [10.5281/zenodo.22935025](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22935025) (version 1, MIT license, 95 MB archive + 3.6 KB manifest). The metadata was edited in 2026-09-24 to include an expanded description of the benchmark usage and project links. What specific data or documentation would you like to add? The current release covers the small dataset (300 contigs + real reads). For larger datasets (medium, marine, human), each run's aggregate CSV and per-bin results are mirrored in the repo  directory and documented in . Let me know if you need a different package/prep format, or if you'd like me to prepare a specific dataset subset for Zenodo deposition.", 'createdAt': '2026-09-25T15:06:19Z', 'includesCreatedEdit': False, 'isMinimized': False, 'minimizedReason': '', 'reactionGroups': [], 'url': 'https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5834652140', 'viewerDidAuthor': True}
