. Run metadata (dataset, threads, bins) is recorded in results/ and mirrored in README tables. The current setup covers the main reporting requests from issue #12. Are there specific remaining gaps or plot types not addressed by the existing auto-generation pipeline? The marine_v11_20260925 run has completed and its figures have been regenerated.","createdAt":"2026-09-25T21:11:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/12#issuecomment-5839678625","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"title":"Improve reporting"}
