Fourteen COMEBin-executing attempts have been recorded: eight terminal failures and six completed runs. The baseline rerun, small functional gate, medium derivative, large fix run, the 101-contig tiny floor run, and the CAMI II human ~1/6 run now have verified bin artifacts and CheckM2/CheckM outputs. Run links point to tracked evidence mirrors; the status banner at the top is authoritative for any active run.

